==Old Norse==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gem-pro|non}} {{recons|fedwōr|lang=gem-pro}}, from {{termx||kʷetwṓr|lang=ine-pro}}, the neuter form of {{etyl|ine-pro|non}} {{recons|kʷetwóres|lang=ine-pro}}.

===Cardinal number===
'''fjórir'''

# [[four]]
#: fjögurra vegna — ''to the four cardinal points''

